Package: padforge
Version: 0.1.0
Section: editors
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libqt6widgets6, libqt6gui6, libqt6core6, libqt6core5compat6, liblua5.4-0
Maintainer: PadForge contributors <padforge@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/Pranav-Lejith/PadForge2
Installed-Size: 4096
Description: Fast native text editor with a Notepad++-style workflow
 PadForge is a native Linux text editor that brings the familiar Notepad++
 workflow to the Qt 6 and Scintilla stack: tabbed documents, split view,
 syntax highlighting for dozens of languages, find and replace with
 find-in-files, bookmarks, macros and a small plugin runtime.
